Done.

**Finding reproduced:** `rb run modules/MathUtils.rb` → `ParserError: Expected function name` at `modules/MathUtils.rb:4:16`, exit 1 (`constant` was in no keyword table).

**Decision:** implement `constant` — SPEC.md §Modules and GRAMMAR §4.1 already specified it; the shipped module was right and the implementation was missing. `constant NAME to expr` binds a program-level name: value in `Vm::globals` (reads resolve through the existing lookup), name in a new `Vm::constants` set (second declaration refused; `Vm::set_var` now returns `Result` and refuses a write that would land on it). Locals of the same name shadow it.

**Changes:** `src/lexer.rs`, `src/parser.rs`, `src/analyzer.rs`, `src/vm.rs`, `src/formatter.rs`, `src/linter.rs`, `src/bytecode/codegen.rs`, regenerated TextMate grammar, SPEC.md + GRAMMAR.md, `tests/constant_test.rs` (12 tests, 6 `edge_*`, 7 assert a failure), plus removal of the two `modules/` corpus exclusions that existed only because of this bug.

**Gates:** `cargo fmt --all -- --check` pass; `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` pass; `cargo test --all-targets` 449 passed / 0 failed; `cargo test --doc` 1 passed; examples 6/6, `rb run modules/MathUtils.rb` exit 0; `rb compile`/`rb lint` on the module both exit 0. **`./rbops/verify.sh phase-024` was NOT run — there is no `rbops/` in this checkout**, and `rbops/baseline.json` therefore could not be edited (rule 1 forbids it); that definition-of-done box is left unticked in `phases/phase-024/REPORT.md` and recorded in `FINDINGS.md` §1 along with 5 other follow-ups (bytecode immutability, unreachable module functions, `module … end` spec drift, unimplemented `: type` annotation, formatter blank-line loss).

DONE
